  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 190°C. Warm the olive oil in a large ovenproof pan or casserole over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion with a pinch of salt and cook for 6–8 minutes until soft and translucent. Stir in the garlic and cook for 30 seconds more.",
    "Add the canned tomatoes, tomato paste, water, oregano, bay leaf, black pepper, chilli flakes, and remaining salt. Simmer for 5 minutes until slightly thickened.",
    "Stir in the cannellini beans and half of the dill. Bring everything to a gentle simmer, then taste and adjust the seasoning.",
    "Transfer to the oven if needed and bake for 25–30 minutes until the sauce is rich and the top looks slightly caramelised at the edges.",
    "Remove the bay leaf, stir through the lemon juice and remaining dill, and serve warm."
  ],
